Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(No.96)混沌之力……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在体内肆意暴走……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道要将我的整个存在彻底抹消吗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我…… 我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能…… 只要能打倒星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕这副身躯被撕裂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也要将这股力量据为己有！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 超越了星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 超越了万物之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…… 是神！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)七座遗迹中的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些遗迹中留下的传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被称为巴利安七皇的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经还是人类时的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而 其中一座遗迹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.11,0:01:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在海底迷宫中我看到的传说里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有鲨鱼和璃绪的身影……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《果然 那两个人……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事 这种感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.61,0:01:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.81,0:01:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)怎么回事，到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)到底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生了什么，究竟怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(上千主上)是那家伙。Numbers 96。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙开始行动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.79,0:01:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他在攻击星光世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其余波也波及到了这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，贝库塔尽快把那家伙找出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Numbers 96)一切都将被毁灭！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让世界回归应有的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)游马，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)啊？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光世界似乎发生了什么异变。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，什么！？星光世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不止如此。恐怕……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.17,0:04:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]异常现象正在世界各地发生。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]火山活动——休眠中的火山喷发{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界各国观测到极光还有流冰将海岸……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)突然火山喷发{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有出现在本不该出现之地的极光。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}南方的岛屿竟然有冰山……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐……姐姐，这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，你也太悠哉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今早开始全世界都闹翻天了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，去采访去采访！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星界？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个人类世界的异变与星界的异变。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是有关系的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 你应该明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白我这股力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:05:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时机已到！ 吸收那家伙由我来掌控世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你 还…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)我们到底…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)黑暗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨大的黑暗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗… 将游马包裹…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}悲剧的序幕…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)可是 游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐 从那之后 一直
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有恢复意识。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 以前她失去意识的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预言过巴利安的事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 这次的事也……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然好转
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也有可能啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且啊我也挺在意鲨鱼的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:05:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)鲨鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙从遗迹回来之后总觉得有点不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么说呢 像是在想什么心事……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼迟早可能会来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}商量一件大事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 什么啊 那是什么意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果他自己不肯说的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不管说什么都是没办法的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法是什么意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 是在烦恼什么吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就别客气直接说出来不就好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算那会给你带来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨大的痛苦，也没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我们可是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事？ 什么跟什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 小鸟？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 看上面。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么？那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好惊人的力量…至今为止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从未遇到过这样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)凯特大人，B3-32点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了极强的重力变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制不住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说…为什么连凯特也在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个地方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可想死你们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.09,0:08:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，还有星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来似乎还有不速之客啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 也罢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你们那里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍后再收下 No.吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}洗干净脖子等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在发生的异变 是你干的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(No.96)好好看着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 不只是星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今我的力量 连巴利安……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有连人类世界都能影响到。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是打算将星光界破坏掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。我打算将它抹消得不留痕迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…… 对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光界不是你的故乡吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此 才要消去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为神的我 不需要什么故乡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧… 算什么神啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵呵… 作为神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 就把你们这些家伙给葬送掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 到决一胜负的时候了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里 将成为你们的坟墓！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)屏障球·领域！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 屏障的领域竟然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧？ 我是神。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对神来说 没有什么是创造不出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不止如此…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这之中我才是绝对的存在！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等待你们的只有 只有 痛苦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢耍这种卑鄙的手段！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太狡猾了！堂堂正正地打啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在这个场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅仅只是待着就会受到伤害…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且不只是我连游马也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能倒下！》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！这场决斗，我们要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔！来做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我。我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 马里脊球·汤匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 马里脊球·小刀 送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 马里脊球·叉子。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马里脊球·叉子 可以将1只马里脊球怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地即可特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动马里斯波拉斯之匙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合１次 当场上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有马里斯波拉斯怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级２以下的马里斯波拉斯怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 马里斯波拉斯之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 和之前在遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的时候一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级２的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马里斯波拉斯之匙 之刃、之叉 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用３只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:11:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.96
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的分身 黑色迷雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 见识一下神之力吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽混沌超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽的阶级提升1阶的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌怪兽超量进化！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级2的黑雾进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伴随混沌的漆黑之风降临吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑风暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.86,0:12:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙走向消灭的倒计时已经开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……这么快就召唤出混沌超量，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.21,0:13:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的战略 肯定有什么名堂。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！ 来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 隆隆隆巨灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 特殊召唤 捣蛋·潜水员。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级4的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 捣蛋·潜水员！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的场上也凑齐怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的隆隆隆巨灵和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}捣蛋·潜水员 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我说了没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不妙！ 这样下去的话…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也一口气上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己的怪兽超量升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用阶级４的希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀着希望的灵魂啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}网罗森罗万象成为引导未来的力量吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什么？那表情是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 异热同心之力的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果已经发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 场上的表侧表示
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡片的效果 全部无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 黑风暴的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}任何效果都无法发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么情况！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你完全中了我设下的计策啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在「Astral」这个场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到大量伤害的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们才是劣势。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，就召唤「混沌怪兽」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在短期决战中寻找活路。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就知道你会来这招。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动，「混沌交错」！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对手特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「混沌怪兽超越」时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其所有的超量素材全部送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择1张场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加入手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择混沌场。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这个回合由于混沌交叉的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有混沌的怪兽不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这里先看那家伙怎么出招。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 身为神的我究极的场地就完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极的场地？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动场地魔法 混沌场！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的混沌超量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量怪兽 送一张去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方的额外卡组中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随机选择1只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其怪兽效果无效
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到自己的场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌力场同样是神的力场。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将痛苦赐予你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么你的 No.怪兽我就收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将黑风暴的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你的额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}释放吧，愤怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.69！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代纹章 臂之纹章！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是托隆的王牌怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，游马的 No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被对方接连夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.99,0:17:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊讶还太早了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌场地的更进一步效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方的额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺来的 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化成高1阶的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连混沌化都。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用纹章兽之袍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.69！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章神 混沌纹章兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽之袍变成了敌人的混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌纹章兽的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到自己场上的怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并获得那只怪兽的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。再这样挨下攻击的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4000的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 你们到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·不死之魔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对希望皇·霍普雷发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·死亡·厄运！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 发动陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱 No.魔法·大师。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只 No.怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组选择1张永续魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并发动其效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是炎之护封剑 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.05,0:19:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 我将
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇·霍普雷解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组发动永续魔法 炎之护封剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上没有怪兽的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽说是走投无路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但能瞬间躲开破灭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就夸你一句吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:19:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算是躲过去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 游马和星光体的危机还是没变。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这张卡是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马这里先不发动 观察一下情况。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放卡片 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是束手无策才对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌场的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将黑·风暴的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量单元送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次从你的额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺取1只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.91,0:20:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到我的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}舍弃虚伪的骸骨，化身为神之龙降临吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.92！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伪骸神龙 心·地·龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是混沌场的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.怪兽进化升阶为
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更高1阶的 CNo.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用心·地·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌升阶变换。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.92！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伪骸虚龙 心·地·混沌龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.81,0:21:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心·地·龙也混沌化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心·地·混沌龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个混沌超量单位使用{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽以及
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱·魔法卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到回合结束时无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 场上盖放的卡也
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这家伙就等同毫无防备。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 游马
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.59,0:22:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就是真正的终结了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.69,0:23:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.52,0:23:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.57,0:24:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
